e(ParallelScope.Fixtures)]). \r\nSeems that different threads trying to take next test when they are finished (it occurs in the end of the run).\r\n\r\n```\r\nCall stack:\r\nThe active test run was aborted. Reason: Unhandled Exception: System.InvalidOperationException: Stack empty.\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at System.Collections.Generic.Stack`1.ThrowForEmptyStack()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at System.Collections.Generic.Stack`1.Pop()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at NUnit.Framework.Internal.Execution.WorkItemQueue.Restore()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at NUnit.Framework.Internal.Execution.ParallelWorkItemDispatcher.RestoreQueues()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at NUnit.Framework.Internal.Execution.ParallelWorkItemDispatcher.OnEndOfShift(WorkShift endingShift)\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at NUnit.Framework.Internal.Execution.WorkShift.<StartWorkers>b__26_1(TestWorker s, WorkItem ea)\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at NUnit.Framework.Internal.Execution.TestWorker.TestWorkerThreadProc()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at System.Threading.Thread.ThreadMain_ThreadStart()\r\n[11:25:57][test]    at System.Threading.ExecutionContext.Run(ExecutionContext executionContext, ContextCallback callback, Object state)\r\n```\r\n\r\nNUnit: 3.10.1\r\nNUnit3testAdapter: 3.10.0\r\nTarget framework: netcoreapp2.0\r\nCI: TeamCity 2017.2.1 (build 50732)\r\nOS: Linux Ubuntu\r\n\r\n_Copied from original issue: nunit/nunit3-vs-adapter#491_","closed_by":{"login":"jnm2","id":8040367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNDAzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8040367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2","html_url":"https://github.com/jnm2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jnm2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https:/